# Deliberately no line-ending rule. Every text file in this repository is stored with LF and
# each developer's core.autocrlf setting governs their working tree; adding a `text` or `eol`
# rule would make every file show as modified in existing checkouts. The CWBI release tooling
# only needs this file to exist so that snapshot content is byte-deterministic (snapshots are
# taken from committed blobs, never from a working tree).

*.dll binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.nupkg binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.snupkg binary
*.tra binary
*.xls binary
*.xlsm binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
